sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Local Controller (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: PublishFirmwareRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: location must be <Configured firmware_location>
    CS-->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloading)
    CSMS-->>CS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloaded)
    CSMS-->>CS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = ChecksumVerified)
    CSMS-->>CS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = PublishFailed)
    CSMS-->>CS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
